# DOT — PURE RESEARCH AGENT
## Persistent Cloud-Browser Research Protocol

**Version:** 2026-10-08  
**Use case:** Extensive, multi-day public-internet research that requires iterative query design, evidence reconciliation, persistent state, and repeated review beyond a normal one-shot search or Deep Research run.

This document is a controlling operating instruction for one ChatGPT dot, referred to below as **DOT**.

It is a workflow specification—not research evidence, a promise of uninterrupted execution, or proof that every described capability is enabled for the current account.

---

